OL,5,G2200 Battlefront: WWII Road to Victory
OL,6,     FAmerican Marines meet Japanese
OL,7,     Finfantry for the first time at
OL,8,     FGuadalcanal. In the jungle, two
OL,9,     Fpowerful armies collide in a
OL,10,     Fbrutal six-month struggle, leaving
OL,11,     Fnearly 30,000 dead.
OL,12,G2230 Battlefront: WWII Road to Victory
OL,13,     FThe Allies launch an ill-fated
OL,14,     Fattack on the German-occupied port
OL,15,     Fof Dieppe, France, where the Nazis
OL,16,     Fproved to be too strong.
OL,17,G2300 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,18,     FJim overpowers Geoff, and Meg is
OL,19,     Fhorrified by the violence. Bea
OL,20,     Fhelps Pat write a letter, but
OL,21,     Fgetting it out isn't a simple
OL,22,     Fmatter.
