OL,12,G0100 The Yorkshire Vet
OL,13,     FShona Searson rushes to an
OL,14,     Femergency calving, while Peter
OL,15,     FWright's patient is a Samoyed - a
OL,16,     Fdog originally bred for herding
OL,17,     Freindeer and pulling sleds in the
OL,18,     FArctic.
